# 10. ⭐ Composition / Aggregation / Association

### Association

General relationship:

```text
Teacher ───────── Student
```

---

### Aggregation

Weak ownership:

```text
Department ◇──── Teacher
```

Teacher can conceptually exist independently.

---

### Composition

Strong ownership:

```text
House ◆──── Room
```

The component is strongly associated with the lifecycle of the containing object.

### Interview shortcut

```text
Association → knows-a
Aggregation → has-a, weak ownership
Composition → has-a, strong ownership
Inheritance → is-a
```

