# 14. ⭐ Static / Final / Private — Override Trap

## Static

Cannot be overridden.

It is **method hiding**.

```java
class Parent {
    static void show() {
        System.out.println("Parent");
    }
}

class Child extends Parent {
    static void show() {
        System.out.println("Child");
    }
}
```

---

## Final

Cannot be overridden.

```java
final void show() {}
```

---

## Private

Cannot be overridden because it is not accessible to subclasses as an inherited method.

```text
static  → hidden
final   → cannot override
private → not inherited/overridden
normal instance method → can be overridden
```

