# 20. Design Pattern Connection

### Strategy Pattern

Uses polymorphism heavily:

```text
PaymentStrategy
      │
 ┌────┼────┐
 ↓    ↓    ↓
UPI  Card Wallet
```

### Factory

Hides object creation:

```text
Client
  ↓
Factory
  ↓
Concrete Object
```

### Template Method

Uses inheritance + polymorphism.

### Decorator

Uses composition to dynamically add behavior.

### Dependency Injection

Uses abstraction + composition + polymorphism.

